{"ID":"20240314092142-y1o2qai","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092142-y1o2qai","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092142-y1o2qai\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161643-4xx4dfq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161643-kklnrbu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161643-kklnrbu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:447,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:447\u0026#125;","title":"【薏苡附子散】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422161643"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422161643-4xx4dfq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422161643-4xx4dfq","updated":"20240422161643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胸痹缓急者，薏苡附子散主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161643-p0zz3f8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161643-p0zz3f8","updated":"20240422161643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"薏苡附子散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161643-blmqiv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161643-blmqiv8","updated":"20240422161643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"薏苡仁十五两，大附子十枚炮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161643-4rpc66s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161643-4rpc66s","updated":"20240422161643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右二味，杵为散，服方寸匕，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161643-a3ygqi1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161643-a3ygqi1","updated":"20240422161643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接下来的这个条辨呢，他说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胸痞缓急者"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，最难懂的就是缓急。这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"缓急的意思就是随气候而改变"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。比如说西医说啊这个风湿性心脏病。你气候一变冷它就开始痛，气候一回温它就好了。这个，时常会坏。有时候发有时候不发。胸痹，那用薏苡附子。诸位解读处方的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"附子是去寒，薏仁是不是去湿？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以这个病人一定是寒湿嘛，所以才会有这个处方出来，所以你要反过来想，那当同气相求，气候当温度下降以后，寒又带点湿气的时候，就会引发那个病，因为病人本来就是有寒湿在身体里面。所以温度一改变，它开始就发病了。空气里面的湿太盛，也会引发，哦，所以时好时坏，这叫胸痞缓急者。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161643-gt6razf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161643-gt6razf","updated":"20240422161643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那临床上我们治疗西医讲的哦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"风湿性心脏病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这两味药就够了。哦，一剂知、二剂已。哦，那使用的时候是等量。你看他怎么使用的啊，薏仁呢，哦，十五两，哦，大附子，你不管它几两。哦，十枚啊怎么样，他是两味药把它打为散剂，是用粉剂来吃的，不是用汤剂。你不要去煮，把它打两个是等量，那每次呢吃一个汤匙，汤匙就是我们现在喝的汤匙的平的汤匙一匙就好了啊，一天吃三次。那这种风湿性心脏病，只要觉得气候改变的，哦，气候，气候一变心脏痛通通可以用，"}]},{"ID":"20240422161643-tnxc6ox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161643-tnxc6ox","updated":"20240422161643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大家在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治疗心脏病，有个诀窍"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。治心脏病呢一定要记得"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"提醒病人保冷"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"被子少盖一点，衣服少穿一件"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那老师这个很多人这个心脏病穿的比较温暖怕得，怕发心脏病，反而穿得多。错了，要冷。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161643-kklnrbu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161643-kklnrbu","updated":"20240422161643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我治疗心脏病的时候，我就会跟病人说，我开始今天帮你治疗啊，下完针，你现在开始每天用冷水去冲脚，每天晚上睡觉前，或者没有事情的时候，电视少看一点，跑去冲，用冷水冲脚。那他说为什么？因为你冷水一冲脚的时候，那个冷的一刺激到脚，脚是离心脏最远的地方。刚开始一两分钟，一两分钟的时候觉得水很冰。但是你一直用那个冰水在冲脚的时候，心脏会收到讯号，诶，太冷了。心脏力量会自己会发动，就会开始搏动，把热导到脚上去。所以你同样是冷水，你不断的冲，一两，一分钟、二分钟到第三分钟以后，你以为水是热的，然后你再去摸，诶，水还是冰的啊，可是你感觉到水冲到脚上是热的，为什么？就是因为你刺激他的心脏。让心脏自己来痊愈。哦，那夏天的时候呢，你用洗冷水澡，冬天的时候叫心脏病的病人去洗冷水澡实在是折磨对不对，用冷水冲脚，夏天的时候最好洗冷水澡。哦，所以治心脏病要保冷。所以很多人呢，冬天到出外去，心脏病的病人呢，少穿一件外套就不容易得心脏病，不容易发心脏病。反而你把身体包的太暖，反而容易得到心脏病，这都是来自黄帝内经的。"}]}]}